<section image-layout="blank" id="EThfByRrhr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="P8HoKmLRhP" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Leadership QBR · A quarter in motion</p><h1 font-size="42pt">Growth continued; customer expansion became the constraint</h1><p font-size="lg">Revenue rose 6% quarter over quarter and gross margin improved 2 points, but net revenue retention fell to 108%.</p><p>The growth engine is working. Leadership’s task is to fund the intervention, tighten pricing, and rebalance commercial capacity.</p><spacer size="18pt"></spacer><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p></grid-item><grid-item id="8HFUYab1YD" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.18" vertical-align="end" padding="20pt" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/Q6cCHfTPsP56tm5XrlSiY.png" saved-media-id="ovvq2t6qen9thw8" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="causal-model-studio" alt="Editorial studio photograph of a functional tabletop growth system assembled from matte warm-white card and machined aluminum, several rails converging on a narrow expansion gate marked by one signal-red intervention lever, restrained green details showing value moving through the system, graphite background, crisp directional light, no text, lettering, screens, logos, or people." meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">Concept imagery · not company evidence.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="09iQX_FwYK"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="EMg7m-NHx6"><h2>The quarter at a glance</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="RwlnCi-VxR" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><display size="md">$24.8M</display><h4>Revenue</h4><p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>6% growth</b></span> quarter over quarter.</p><labels><label variant="outline">96% of plan</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="COEd15TYnH" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><display size="md">61%</display><h4>Gross margin</h4><p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>Up 2 points</b></span> from the prior quarter.</p><labels><label variant="outline">1 point below plan</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="tbKQoeZkon" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><display size="md">108%</display><h4>Net revenue retention</h4><p><span text-color="accent"><b>Down 2 points</b></span> quarter over quarter.</p><labels><label variant="solid">2 points below plan</label></labels></grid-item><grid-item id="POtPbsltk4" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><display size="md">−$0.6M</display><h4>Free cash flow</h4><p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>Improved $1.1M</b></span> in the quarter.</p><labels><label variant="outline">$0.2M below plan</label></labels></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="Gny-3XX2p9"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="1thrOdDFuV"><h2>Four quarters reveal a quality trade-off</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item id="1tAwxj6BXF" colspan="20"><h4>Revenue ($M)</h4><graph chart-type="line" show-data-labels="true" line-weight="md" text-size="sm" config="{&quot;appearance&quot;:{&quot;customSeriesColors&quot;:{&quot;series1&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#17715B&quot;}}},&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="260pt" height="205pt"><properties><property key="quarter" label="Quarter" type="label"></property><property key="revenue" label="Revenue ($M)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Q−3</cell><cell>21.2</cell></row><row><cell>Q−2</cell><cell>22.1</cell></row><row><cell>Q−1</cell><cell>23.4</cell></row><row><cell>Current</cell><cell>24.8</cell></row></data></graph></grid-item><grid-item id="b2r_TpzUEV" colspan="20"><h4>Gross margin (%)</h4><graph chart-type="line" show-data-labels="true" line-weight="md" text-size="sm" config="{&quot;appearance&quot;:{&quot;customSeriesColors&quot;:{&quot;series1&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#17715B&quot;}}},&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="260pt" height="205pt"><properties><property key="quarter" label="Quarter" type="label"></property><property key="margin" label="Gross margin (%)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Q−3</cell><cell>57</cell></row><row><cell>Q−2</cell><cell>58</cell></row><row><cell>Q−1</cell><cell>59</cell></row><row><cell>Current</cell><cell>61</cell></row></data></graph></grid-item><grid-item id="-ErmPFrMPl" colspan="20"><h4>Net revenue retention (%)</h4><graph chart-type="line" show-data-labels="true" line-weight="md" text-size="sm" config="{&quot;appearance&quot;:{&quot;customSeriesColors&quot;:{&quot;series1&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#D63F24&quot;}}},&quot;legend&quot;:{&quot;position&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}" width="260pt" height="205pt"><properties><property key="quarter" label="Quarter" type="label"></property><property key="nrr" label="Net revenue retention (%)" type="data"></property></properties><data><row><cell>Q−3</cell><cell>114</cell></row><row><cell>Q−2</cell><cell>112</cell></row><row><cell>Q−1</cell><cell>110</cell></row><row><cell>Current</cell><cell>108</cell></row></data></graph></grid-item></grid><p><b>Acquisition and efficiency strengthened while customer expansion softened for four consecutive quarters.</b></p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="Gl2lxGX4hJ"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="L-alQ7bJT6"><h2>The bridge from result to cause</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><h3>Revenue bridge · $M</h3><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="QMbPsTQBbs" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4>$23.4</h4><p font-size="sm">Prior quarter</p></grid-item><grid-item id="48SgN5PkY8" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="8"><h4><span text-color="palette-2">+$1.0</span></h4><p font-size="sm">New business</p></grid-item><grid-item id="-wtjmjYmUK" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="8"><h4><span text-color="palette-2">+$0.7</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Expansion</p></grid-item><grid-item id="n8rzAuLwqW" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="8"><h4><span text-color="palette-2">+$0.3</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Price &amp; mix</p></grid-item><grid-item id="SF61BvmgWq" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="8"><h4><span text-color="accent">−$0.5</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Churn</p></grid-item><grid-item id="UykQ12zkKh" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="8"><h4><span text-color="accent">−$0.1</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Currency</p></grid-item><grid-item id="EXNK_sgkSA" background-color="palette-2" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4>$24.8</h4><p font-size="sm">Current quarter</p></grid-item></grid><h3>Gross-margin bridge · percentage points</h3><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="7hZBkCbvXe" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4>59%</h4><p font-size="sm">Prior quarter</p></grid-item><grid-item id="Ca_w18n7ZG" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4><span text-color="palette-2">+1.0</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Mix</p></grid-item><grid-item id="XGtHYb-HKl" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4><span text-color="palette-2">+0.8</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Infrastructure</p></grid-item><grid-item id="2yZ1suM1ms" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4><span text-color="palette-2">+0.5</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Delivery</p></grid-item><grid-item id="SWqXIZmJTg" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4>−0.3</h4><p font-size="sm">Discounting</p></grid-item><grid-item id="KJUlnfIzSz" background-color="palette-2" padding="12pt 8pt" colspan="10"><h4>61%</h4><p font-size="sm">Current quarter</p></grid-item></grid><p><b>The bridges reconcile:</b> growth came primarily from new business, while discounting remained the visible margin leak.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="OAGeWAnrd6"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="xNSNB7prms"><h2>Three leading risks could break the plan</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><table col-widths="[18,12,14,38,18]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false"><tbody><tr><td><p>Leading risk</p></td><td><p>Current</p></td><td><p>Guardrail / target</p></td><td><p>Required response</p></td><td><p>Owner</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Demand</b><br>Pipeline coverage</p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>2.7×</b></p></td><td><p>3.0×</p></td><td><p>Sales intervenes if mid-quarter coverage remains below 2.8×.</p></td><td><p>Sales</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Adoption</b><br>Onboarding time</p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>18 days</b></p></td><td><p>14 days</p></td><td><p>Recover onboarding performance to the stated target.</p></td><td><p>Customer leadership</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Concentration</b><br>Top-ten revenue share</p></td><td background-color="palette-3"><p><b>34%</b></p></td><td><p>30%</p></td><td><p>Monitor exposure while commercial capacity shifts toward expansion.</p></td><td><p>Finance</p></td></tr></tbody></table><aside variant="warning"><p>All three signals are outside their guardrail or target before the quarter begins.</p></aside></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="UotTMWoZcz" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="N3b49-LU3U"><h2>Three leadership choices unlock the next quarter</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative decision asks — not company data.</b> <b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="aoK1Tbpoyl" cell-style="subtle" colspan="20"><labels><label variant="solid">Approve</label></labels><h3>Fund the onboarding intervention</h3><p>Invest <b>$0.4M</b> in an onboarding pod to address the adoption constraint.</p><hr color="neutral-border"><h4>Modeled outcome</h4><p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>18 to 14 days</b></span> and <span text-color="palette-2"><b>1 point of retention recovery</b></span>.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="0Vk3lTF2iW" cell-style="subtle" colspan="20"><labels><label variant="solid">Approve</label></labels><h3>Protect price discipline</h3><p>Set a <b>12% discount guardrail</b>, with CFO exceptions, to close the visible margin leak.</p><hr color="neutral-border"><h4>Modeled outcome</h4><p><span text-color="palette-2"><b>0.3 margin points protected.</b></span></p></grid-item><grid-item id="YwiyrflsQi" cell-style="subtle" colspan="20"><labels><label variant="solid">Confirm</label></labels><h3>Rebalance commercial capacity</h3><p>Redirect <b>two open commercial roles</b> from acquisition to expansion coverage.</p><hr color="neutral-border"><h4>Driver addressed</h4><p>Make customer expansion—not acquisition—the next unit of commercial capacity.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="1mp6H32b8e"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="S-Efe58Nvt"><h2>The next-quarter plan links actions to outcomes</h2><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="yuTU44RqEe" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><p font-size="34pt"><b>$26.0M</b></p><h4>Revenue</h4><p font-size="sm">Quarter-end outcome</p></grid-item><grid-item id="8FtPwYyi9u" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><p font-size="34pt"><b>62%</b></p><h4>Gross margin</h4><p font-size="sm">Quarter-end outcome</p></grid-item><grid-item id="3PF9u5FUj-" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><p font-size="34pt"><b>109%</b></p><h4>Retention</h4><p font-size="sm">Quarter-end outcome</p></grid-item><grid-item id="2jkHmStH3Z" vertical-align="center" colspan="15"><p font-size="34pt"><b>$0.2M</b></p><h4>Free cash flow</h4><p font-size="sm">Positive at quarter end</p></grid-item></grid><h3>Operating milestones</h3><smart-layout variant="minimalTimeline" orientation="horizontal" cell-size="15"><smart-layout-item><h4>Days 1–30 · Build the controls</h4><p>Staff the onboarding pod and publish pricing rules.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Days 31–60 · Move the indicators</h4><p>Reduce the onboarding backlog and activate expansion plays.</p></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><h4>Quarter end · Scale what works</h4><p>Scale only interventions that improve leading indicators.</p></smart-layout-item></smart-layout></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="q1EwWyu_Qr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="JBPrIAp-x9" vertical-align="center" colspan="39"><p role="eyebrow">Leadership operating loop</p><h2>Close the loop: decide, measure, adapt</h2><p><b>Today:</b> approve, adjust, or defer the three proposed choices.</p><p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p><smart-layout variant="cycle" cell-size="20"><smart-layout-item><icon class="accessory-image" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/b3ixZPPHhbrZgkjxED3BoK.svg?stroke=45" source="image.pictographic.icon" alt="executive decision approval"></icon><div><h4>Decide today</h4><p>Set the interventions and owners.</p></div></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><icon class="accessory-image" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/40KEJyJWZ7taej6IQfKb.svg?stroke=45" source="image.pictographic.icon" alt="thirty day operating review"></icon><div><h4>Measure at day 30</h4><p>Report staffing, pricing compliance, pipeline coverage, and onboarding time.</p></div></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><icon class="accessory-image" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/XtHWjuy4pTNe5lnuIgs5.svg?stroke=45" source="image.pictographic.icon" alt="leadership contingency review"></icon><div><h4>Adapt at day 60</h4><p>Review retention trajectory and release contingency capacity if triggers are breached.</p></div></smart-layout-item><smart-layout-item><icon class="accessory-image" src="https://iconscdn.pictographic.ai/image/oBwXBqKzMgQqn2s8fxEaSN.svg?stroke=45" source="image.pictographic.icon" alt="balanced business outcomes assessment"></icon><div><h4>Assess at quarter end</h4><p>Judge durable growth across revenue, margin, retention, and cash—not growth alone.</p></div></smart-layout-item></smart-layout></grid-item><grid-item id="Ox2nw-WytX" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.2" vertical-align="end" padding="20pt" colspan="21"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/E3saE4HNdEA3QgB0bVJSf.png" saved-media-id="6fidw9fjfzf7i2s" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="causal-model-studio" alt="Editorial studio photograph of a closed-loop tabletop operating model made from matte warm-white card and machined aluminum, four linked stations connected by a continuous graphite rail, one signal-red decision lever and restrained green indicators showing protected value returning to the starting gate, crisp directional light, no text, lettering, screens, logos, or people." meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"><p role="caption">Concept imagery · not company evidence.</p></grid-item></grid></section>